{"id":"5e050274b891eb53","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-intrinsically-computable-relation.md","title":"Intrinsically Computable Relation","display":"df-intrinsically-computable-relation — Intrinsically Computable Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-intrinsically-computable-relation","aliases":["68-df-intrinsically-computable-relation"],"display":"df-intrinsically-computable-relation — Intrinsically Computable Relation","depends_on":["[[68-df-structure]]","[[68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]","[[68-df-computable-structure]]","[[68-df-degree-spectrum]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"External intrinsic-computability extension; not located in supplied §§1-20","verification_status":"external-source-unverified","source_proof_status":"definition-reviewed","external_verification_status":"unverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_basis":"supplied-68(1).zip; local content, type, and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-intrinsically-computable-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-intrinsically-computable-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-intrinsically-computable-relation — Intrinsically Computable Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"27dbc26143606cc1\" href=\"?note=27dbc26143606cc1\" title=\"68-df-structure\">68-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e61d0905238a638\" href=\"?note=5e61d0905238a638\" title=\"68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy\">68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"41bf4c1fd4079b59\" href=\"?note=41bf4c1fd4079b59\" title=\"68-df-computable-structure\">68-df-computable-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"93be4ecb17896d81\" href=\"?note=93be4ecb17896d81\" title=\"68-df-degree-spectrum\">68-df-degree-spectrum</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"External intrinsic-computability extension; not located in supplied §§1-20"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"external-source-unverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"external_verification_status","html":"unverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68(1).zip; local content, type, and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Structure}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Structure}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_A=\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(D_A=\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq D_A^n\">\\(R\\subseteq D_A^n\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 是结构签名之外的额外关系。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompStruct},\\mathrm{Iso}_{68},\\mathrm{Recursive}^{(n)},f^{\\times n}[R]\">\\(\\mathrm{CompStruct},\\mathrm{Iso}_{68},\\mathrm{Recursive}^{(n)},f^{\\times n}[R]\\)</span> 见所列直接依赖。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IntrComp}^{(n)}\">\\(\\mathrm{IntrComp}^{(n)}\\)</span> 为下式定义的谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IntrComp}^{(n)}(R,\\mathfrak A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall\\mathfrak B\\;\\forall f\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\mathrm{CompStruct}(\\mathfrak B)\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_{68}(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\Longrightarrow f^{\\times n}[R]\\in\\mathrm{Recursive}^{(n)}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IntrComp}^{(n)}(R,\\mathfrak A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall\\mathfrak B\\;\\forall f\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\mathrm{CompStruct}(\\mathfrak B)\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_{68}(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\Longrightarrow f^{\\times n}[R]\\in\\mathrm{Recursive}^{(n)}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>仅在可计算副本中检验 R 的像。多元 R 的正确搬运是坐标像 f^{×n}[R]，不是把元素函数 f 直接作用于元组集合。若 A 没有可计算副本，此全称条件真空成立；与 DegSpec_c={0} 对应时必须额外假设存在可计算副本。原书全文未定位本定义，维持外部待核验的来源边界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"27dbc26143606cc1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"5e61d0905238a638","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-computable-structure","status":"resolved","id":"41bf4c1fd4079b59","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-computable-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-degree-spectrum","status":"resolved","id":"93be4ecb17896d81","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-degree-spectrum]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Structure}(\\mathfrak A)","display":false},{"tex":"D_A=\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq D_A^n","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompStruct},\\mathrm{Iso}_{68},\\mathrm{Recursive}^{(n)},f^{\\times n}[R]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IntrComp}^{(n)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IntrComp}^{(n)}(R,\\mathfrak A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall\\mathfrak B\\;\\forall f\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\mathrm{CompStruct}(\\mathfrak B)\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_{68}(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\Longrightarrow f^{\\times n}[R]\\in\\mathrm{Recursive}^{(n)}\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1884,"backlinks":[{"id":"879b42e91247e55b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[68-df-intrinsically-computable-relation|df-intrinsically-computable-relation — Intrinsically Computable Relation]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-intrinsically-computable-relation]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-87","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-intrinsically-computable-relation|df-intrinsically-computable-relation — Intrinsically Computable Relation]]"}],"outgoing":["27dbc26143606cc1","5e61d0905238a638","41bf4c1fd4079b59","93be4ecb17896d81"]}